.nh
.TH "PB-DOMAIN-REMOVE" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-domain-remove - Remove a domain no tunnel or preview uses


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb domain remove <domain> [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove a domain no tunnel or preview uses

.PP
Remove a domain after confirmation. Refused while a tunnel or preview uses a name under it; your DNS records stay at your provider.

.PP
JSON output is supported with --json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--confirm\fP=""
	six-character confirmation code from the preview

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for remove

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print JSON


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb-domain(1)\fP
